+/* ========================================
+   PORTRAIT PLAYERS FOR SHORTS (14 Oct)
+   The players were 16:9, so a vertical Short filled only the middle half of the box between two black bars.
+   They are now 9:16 (like the gallery player in css/arcane-player.css), capped so a player, its buttons and its vote
